898 0 obj
<</Title(Ambers\220 legend Jon Froggatt was handed the reins alongside Mark Ward ahead of the 2023-2024 season, and an excellent start saw The Ambers within touching distance of top spot, before a desperate run of form through the Winter saw the team drop alarmingly before a late resurgence claimed an improved 13th placed finish. Improvement continued the following season, with The Ambers securing an excellent 7th placed finish after an enjoyable, if sometimes frustrating season, a position The Ambers matched with a better points tally last season when they were still in the hunt for a play off spot until the penultimate game of the season.)/Dest[29 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 902 0 R/Next 871 0 R>>
endobj

